<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Lonrho Sugar lifts half yr shr, div.</title>
<headline>Lonrho Sugar lifts half yr shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr ended September 30.</p>
<p>			(E'million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr		     76.2 cts	vs  72.5 cts</p>
<p>    Div		     20.0 cts	vs  19.0 cts</p>
<p>    Attrib income	 91.15	   vs  86.73</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		216.64	   vs 189.69</p>
<p>    Tax		     69.60	   vs  42.21</p>
<p>    Interest paid	 10.63	   vs  14.48</p>
<p>    Turnover	     606.18	   vs 516.13</p>
<p>Div payable December 13 on register November 29</p>
<p>Full name:  Lonrho Sugar Corporation Ltd (industrial/food)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
